      "hizbQuarter": 204,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4583,
      "text": "O you who are being called to spend in Allah’s way; among you are some who greedily withhold, but whoever withholds, he in fact withholds against himself, for Allah is the Self-Sufficient, whereas you are in need [of Him]. If you turn away, He will replace you with other people, then they will not be like you.",
